    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i dont really want to go to the doctor just for this, it seems like a lot of hassle and expensive for just a supplement. is there like a specific way i could take it to make it safer? like maybe a lower dose or taking it at a different time of day so it doesn't mess with my pill? i just want to know if there's a way to do it without the risk.",
